### List agent events
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/agent-events

### Green tick — event only (no owner decision)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/agents/1/tick
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventType": "routine_digest",
  "summary": "NEXUS routine pedagogical digest",
  "detail": "No owner action required.",
  "semaphore": "green"
}

### Yellow tick — creates pending owner decision
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/agents/4/tick
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventType": "venue_booking_wait",
  "summary": "STAGE asks owner to approve venue assignment",
  "detail": "Show estimate below 1500 USDC for Foro Disponible.",
  "semaphore": "yellow"
}
